# Rasterised asset exports (generated by scripts/export_assets.py)
assets/export/
# ...but keep the rasterised README gallery figures (override the global *.png ignore above)
!assets/figures/*.png
# ...and the workbench screenshot embedded in the docs manual
!docs/user-guide/workbench.png
# ...and the annotated workbench control screenshots for the user manual
!docs/workbench/img/*.png
# ...and the workbench demo data bundle (released, redistributable benchmark CSVs) so the
# local app runs out-of-the-box on a fresh clone (override the global *.csv ignore above)
!swissrivernetwork/app/data/**

